<h3 class="heading-size-3" id="valor-points">Valor Points for Protection Paladin Tank Phase 4</h3>This list is somewhat non exhaustive and primarily only include gear that we think are realistically well proportioned towards BiS or fit special niches in your path as you gear. As with all gearing it's also not the ultimate conclusion or hard guide (unless said so) on how to spend your VP. Naturally if you acquire similar or better gear from the raid itself, you should overlook that particular VP slot and reconsider this list in its entirety.<br/>
<br/>That is also to say that items we did not list are useless or necessarily bad, they simply do not fit into our vision and they could be put to use by yourself if you so desired to.<br/>
