<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="shoulders-for-protection-paladin-tank">Shoulders for Protection Paladin Tank</h4>Your shoulder slot has a lot of variance if you will it in phase 4, being eligible for enabling both tier sets as well as running an off-set piece.<br/>
<br/>We favor the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78745/shoulderguards-of-radiant-glory">Protection Tier Shoulders</a> as it permits the user to easily swap out one of their other slots to easily pick up the 4-piece should they want it, though qualitatively speaking it is the lesser (but not by any substantial amount) option here.<br/>
<br/>This <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78367/brackenshell-shoulderplates">Off-Set pair of shoulders</a> are also competitive but relatively speaking we do not consider what they offer to be in particularly high demand.<br/>
<br/>Lastly but not least, the <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78742/pauldrons-of-radiant-glory">Retribution Tier Shoulders</a> have a lot of potential though we consider this to be the weakest slot to pick up its 2-piece bonus.<div class="box" data-level="null">
