<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="wrist-for-protection-paladin-tank">Wrist for Protection Paladin Tank</h4>While you are offered a lot of choice in this slot, the nuance gets lost in that this is overall a weak item slot as such different itemization has very poor expression on the rest of your stats. That said while <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78390/graveheart-bracers">
<img alt="Graveheart Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Graveheart Bracers</span></a> are qualitatively your best choice here, you can more or less skip a (small) step in the gearing process by crafting <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=71993/titanguard-wristplates">
<img alt="Titanguard Wristplates" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Titanguard Wristplates</span></a>.<br/>
<br/>Other than the <i>obvious</i> <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78373/rockhide-bracers">
<img alt="Rockhide Bracers" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_bracer_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Rockhide Bracers</span></a>, is a pair of DPS wrists that mostly mirror #1 in effectiveness but leans slightly in the direction of better performance. We don't think you should contest DPS gear but all the same, it bears mentioning here.<br/>
<br/>
<span class="icontiny lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/quest-start.gif");'></span> Leatherworking is more or less BiS this phase, keep an eye out for <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=85007/draconic-embossment-stamina">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_leatherworking.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Draconic Embossment - Stamina</span></a>.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Wrist Enchants</b>: <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74229/enchant-bracer-superior-dodge">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Superior Dodge</span></a> = <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=62256/enchant-bracer-major-stamina">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_enchant_formulasuperior_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Major Stamina</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74239/enchant-bracer-greater-expertise">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engraving.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Enchant Bracer - Greater Expertise</span></a> &gt; <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=74232/enchant-bracer-precision">
