<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="waist-for-protection-paladin-tank">Waist for Protection Paladin Tank</h4>While your #1 choice here is generally qualitatively better than its counterparts there are circumstances (around Mastery and boss damage patterns) where you could run some of the other waists to great success. To elaborate somewhat <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78452/gorionas-collar">
<img alt="Goriona's Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Goriona's Collar</span></a>, are completely devoid of mastery and while they still offer you a reasonable chunk of (better) avoidance, running any of the other belts will still net you higher returns in that particular aspect.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78416/runescriven-demon-collar">
<img alt="Runescriven Demon Collar" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Runescriven Demon Collar</span></a> is a very solid belt in that regard, however being a DPS piece we do not think you should contest this without paying careful heed to your fellow raiders beforehand. If it's free, we do think it's worth picking up however.<br/>
<br/>The other alternatives are mostly just stepping stones to better things, <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78889/waistplate-of-the-desecrated-future">
<img alt="Waistplate of the Desecrated Future" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raiddeathknight_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Waistplate of the Desecrated Future</span></a> is a raid-wide <a data-entity="zone" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/zone=5892/dragon-soul">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Dragon Soul</span></a> drop and <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77186/forgesmelter-waistplate">
<img alt="Forgesmelter Waistplate" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_plate_raidwarrior_k_01.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Forgesmelter Waistplate</span></a> for VP are not a shabby pick ups while you're still on the treadmill.<div class="box" data-level="null">
<b>Waist Enchants</b>: <a class="q3 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=55054/ebonsteel-belt-buckle">
<img alt="Ebonsteel Belt Buckle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_belt_83.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Ebonsteel Belt Buckle</span></a> is a universal item enhancement for your belt. <a href="https://www.wowhead.com/wotlk/skill=202/engineering">Engineers</a> also get access to a <a class="icontiny" data-entity="spell" data-entity-has-icon="true" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/spell=55016/nitro-boosts">
<img alt="" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/trade_engineering.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Nitro Boosts</span></a>.</div>
