<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="rings-for-protection-paladin-tank">Rings for Protection Paladin Tank</h4>As rings generally come in many formats you can use this slot to express your preferred gear style, while we're leaning into mastery in this phase you don't have to. Just beware that rings may be very contested from other raid members and if you have access to good rings, we suggest you overlook your personal ambitions in favor of theirs.<div class="box" data-level="null">
