<h4 class="heading-size-4" id="trinkets-for-protection-paladin-tank">Trinkets for Protection Paladin Tank</h4>Trinket choices are excessively streamlined here and are mostly stat sticks with few meaningful choices other than which stat you want to go stonks. As usual, stamina is universally good and applicable to all forms of damage, mastery has impact on blockable damage sequences.<br/>
<br/>The passives &amp; on-uses are largely moot or outright useless. Exceptionally <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=78003/indomitable-pride">
<img alt="Indomitable Pride" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_qirajidol_rebirth.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Indomitable Pride</span></a> will more or less always be equipped once you have it, with an always useful passive and a lot of stamina, the nuance is completely gone from this item but is nontheless powerful.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77117/fire-of-the-deep">
<img alt="Fire of the Deep" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/spell_fire_burnout.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Fire of the Deep</span></a> is your go-to mastery trinket with a wholly uninteresting on-use that may or may not help you sometimes if you use it well. <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=69138/spidersilk-spindle">
<img alt="Spidersilk Spindle" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_trinket_firelands_02.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Spidersilk Spindle</span></a> also exist in this same category, less stats for a mitigative passive effect.<br/>
<br/>
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/cata/item=77990/soulshifter-vortex">
<img alt="Soulshifter Vortex" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/ability_druid_cyclone.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Soulshifter Vortex</span></a> is worn almost exclusively for its stamina, the passive will effectively double your mastery and since you have a hard cap, you're never utilizing this proc that well.<div class="pad"></div>
